Package: martinmunk-alsa-control-avr
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ALSA control plugins for AV receivers
 ALSA external control plugins for controlling AV receivers through
 various communication backends.
 .
 Includes plugins for:
  - Denon/Marantz IP control (telnet)
  - NAD serial/ethernet control
  - Opalum RS232 control
  - HDMI-CEC control
 .
 Also includes avr-power utility for power control via ALSA.
